INSERT INTO `pokedex` VALUES (2,8,1,'Being more intelligent than humans, they are very calm. They photosynthesize with their tails.','Grass Snake',2),(3,16,1,'They avoid fouling their clothes to keep clean. They deftly dodge attacks using ivy cords.','Grass Snake',3),(4,63,3,'It raises its head to intimidate opponents with its piercing glare. It only fights at full power.','Regal',4),(5,10,1,'It can deftly dodge attacks and blow fireballs from its nose. It roasts berries with its fire.','Fire Pig',5),(6,56,1,'When its internal fire flares up, its speed and agility increase. It uses smoke to conceal itself.','Fire Pig',6),(7,150,2,'It can throw powerful punches with fists wrapped in flames. It cares deeply about its allies.','Mega Fire Pig',7),(8,6,1,'The scalchard on its stomach is made of the same material as its claws. It uses it for defense.','Sea Otter',8),(9,25,1,'Strict training allows it to learn the complex sword techniques needed to handle its scalchard.','Disciplined',9),(10,95,2,'In the blink of an eye, it can draw and sheath the seamitars attached to its front legs.','Samurai',10),(11,12,1,'Extremely cautious, they take turns standing guard to watch for danger around their burrows.','Scout',11),(12,27,1,'Using the luminescent matter in their eyes, they make their eyes glow to see in the dark.','Watcher',12),(13,11,0,'They give orders to their allies using a complex series of barks and tail positions.','Puppy',13),(14,38,1,'The long fur covering its body acts as an effective armor, absorbing heavy impacts.','Loyal Dog',14),(15,31,1,'This extremely loyal Pokémon helps its Trainer with great courage and absolute devotion.','Herd',15),(16,4,0,'They steal things from people for fun, but their victims can rarely stay angry at them.','Devious',16),(17,64,1,'These Pokémon stealthily slip behind their targets and strike from the shadows.','Cruel Cat',17),(18,5,1,'It is good at finding berries and shares them with its friends. It stores energy in its tuft.','Grass Monkey',18),(19,28,1,'Wild tempers are its hallmark. It strikes opponents relentlessly with its thorny tail.','Thorn Monkey',19),(20,5,1,'It roasts berries before eating them. It loves helping others and sharing food.','High Temp',20),(21,28,1,'It showers the battlefield with embers from its tail when it gets excited in battle.','Ember',21),(22,5,1,'The water stored in its hair tuft is full of nutrients. It uses its tail to spray water.','Spray',22),(23,29,1,'It prefers clean environments. It can spray high-pressure water streams from its tail.','Geyser',23),(24,23,1,'It eats the dreams of people and Pokémon. When it eats a pleasant dream, it expels pink smoke.','Dream Eater',24),(25,61,1,'The mist exhaled from its forehead changes color depending on the dreams it has eaten.','Drowsing',25),(26,2,0,'These Pokémon live in cities and parks. They gather in large numbers where food is available.','Tiny Pigeon',26),(27,15,1,'No matter where in the world it goes, it never loses its way or forgets its trainer.','Wild Pigeon',27),(28,29,1,'Males have a prominent crest on their heads. They fly faster than any other regional bird.','Proud',28),(29,30,1,'Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. It communicates through rhythmic flashes.','Electrified',29),(30,80,2,'They have great stamina and run at lightning speed. Their manes spark when fully charged.','Lightning',30),(31,18,0,'Born deep underground, its body is as hard as steel. It compresses energy inside its core.','Mantle',31),(32,102,1,'Because its orange crystal core is visible, it is sought after by collectors of rare minerals.','Ore',32),(33,260,2,'The compressed energy inside its body can be fired from its crystals with immense power.','Megaton',33),(34,2,0,'The ultrasonic waves it emits from its nose are strong enough to shatter large rocks.','Bat',34),(35,11,1,'It fastens itself to cave walls using its nose. It emits psychic waves when it is happy.','Courting',35),(36,5,0,'It uses its claws to dig tunnels through the earth at speeds exceeding 30 miles per hour.','Mole',36),(37,40,1,'Its steel claws can pierce thick iron plates. It can rotate its body like a drill.','Drill',37),(38,31,1,'It touches others with the feelers on its ears using its heartbeat to gauge their feelings.','Hearing',38),(39,22,1,'It always carries a log. It fights by swinging it skillfully with its strong arms.','Muscular',39),(40,40,1,'It strengthens its body by carrying heavy steel beams. It assists in constructions.','Muscular',40),(41,87,1,'Rather than relying on raw force, it uses concrete pillars with incredible martial skill.','Muscular',41),(42,2,0,'It vibrates its tail to generate a sound wave that warns its allies of incoming danger.','Tadpole',42),(43,16,1,'It lives both in water and on land. It can shoot high-pressure mud from its mouth.','Vibration',43),(44,62,2,'It can increase the power of its punches by vibrating the bumps on its fists.','Vibration',44),(45,56,1,'When it encounters foes bigger than itself, it tries to throw them. It tightens its belt to get stronger.','Judoka',45),(46,51,1,'Desiring to overpower its rivals with karate chops, it heads into mountains to train.','Karate',46),(47,2,0,'It uses its thin, sharp leaf blades to cut food. It wraps itself in a leaf for protection.','Sewing',47),(48,7,1,'It stays quiet inside its leaf wrap, converting nutrients into energy for evolution.','Leaf-Wrapped',48),(49,29,1,'It sews clothes for small Pokémon using leaves and silk spun from its mouth.','Nurturing',49),(50,5,0,'Its bite contains a highly toxic substance. It curls up when threatened to protect itself.','Centipede',50),(51,59,1,'It stores poison energy inside its hard shell. It spins rapidly to ram its opponents.','Curlipede',51),(52,201,3,'With its aggressive nature, it chases down enemies and strikes them with its toxic horns.','Megapede',52),(53,1,0,'When attacked, it expels cotton from its body as a decoy to make its escape.','Cotton Puff',53),(54,7,1,'It can slip through any small gap by changing its body shape. It rides the wind.','Windveiled',54),(55,1,1,'The leaf on its head is highly valued for its fragrance and medicinal properties.','Bulb',55),(56,16,1,'The beautiful flower on its head blooms when it receives plenty of sunlight and care.','Flowering',56),(57,18,1,'They are extremely territorial and fight fiercely against other groups over food resources.','Hostile',57),(58,5,1,'It burrows into the sand to hide from predators. It tracks prey by sensing vibrations.','Desert Croc',58),(59,33,1,'The dark membrane protecting its eyes allows it to see clearly through fierce sandstorms.','Desert Croc',59),(60,96,2,'It has powerful jaws that can crush an automobile. It never lets go of its prey.','The Intimidation',60),(61,3,1,'Its internal fire burns hotter when it gets excited. It loves eating round berries.','Zen Charm',61),(62,93,1,'When weakened, it enters a meditative state, becoming completely still like a statue.','Blazing',62),(63,11,1,'It lives in arid deserts. It moves rhythmically to generate sounds like maracas.','Cactus',63),(64,13,0,'It cuts rocks with its sharp claws to make a suitable shell for its fragile body.','Rock Dweller',64),(65,200,1,'It can carry heavy boulders on its back without slowing down. Its shell is incredibly tough.','Stone Home',65),(66,4,1,'It always stares at its opponents with a rebellious expression, ready for a fight.','Shedding',66),(67,30,1,'It takes pride in its modern style. It defends its territory with extreme stubbornness.','Hoodlum',67),(68,34,1,'It uses psychic power to keep its body floating. It is covered in ancient patterns.','Avianoid',68),(69,2,1,'It arose from the spirit of a human buried in ancient times. It retains memories of its past.','Spirit',69),(70,77,2,'It can mimic a beautiful golden coffin to trick grave robbers and trap them inside.','Coffin',70),(71,5,1,'It was revived from an ancient fossil. It can dive deep into the ocean to hunt.','Prototurtle',71),(72,81,1,'Its incredible jaw strength allows it to crush solid rock and shell-covered prey.','Prototurtle',72),(73,10,1,'Said to be the ancestor of all bird Pokémon, it lived in trees and glided rather than flew.','First Bird',73),(74,32,1,'It can run faster than it flies. It works in teams to corner and capture its prey.','First Bird',74),(75,14,1,'It loves dirty environments and follows people who throw garbage on the streets.','Trash Bag',75),(76,107,2,'It consumes garbage to grow larger. It sprays toxic fluid from its right hand.','Trash Heap',76),(77,13,1,'It can transform into people or other Pokémon to hide its true identity from others.','Tricky Fox',77),(78,81,2,'It has the power to trap thousands of people in a world of illusions and trickery.','Illusion Fox',78),(79,6,0,'They are very neat and use their tails like a broom to clean their nesting areas.','Chinchilla',79),(80,8,1,'Its white fur is coated in a special oil that repels static electricity and dirt.','Scarf',80),(81,10,0,'They intently stare at stars. Their psychic powers increase when they perceive starlight.','Fixation',81),(82,18,1,'They use psychic power to control stones and keep them floating around their bodies.','Manipulate',82),(83,44,2,'Starry skies are the source of their power. They are said to see the future from the alignment of stars.','Astral',83),(84,1,0,'The liquid inside its cell-like outer body allows it to survive in any environment.','Cell',84),(85,8,1,'Since it has two brains, it can unleash powerful psychic attacks with perfect timing.','Mitosis',85),(86,20,1,'When its three brains align their thoughts, its psychic abilities increase dramatically.','Multiplying',86),(87,6,1,'It flies over lakes and rivers to catch small fish. It is a very graceful swimmer.','Waterbird',87),(88,24,1,'It can unleash elegant physical attacks using its powerful and flexible wings.','White Bird',88),(89,6,0,'It can freeze the moisture in the air around it to create a shield of cold air.','Fresh Snow',89),(90,41,1,'It stores large amounts of snow inside its body and expels it during battles.','Icy Snow',90),(91,58,1,'It generates massive blizzards from its two heads, freezing everything around it.','Snowstorm',91),(92,20,1,'The color and scent of its fur change depending on the current season of the year.','Season',92),(93,93,2,'The leader of the herd. The horns on its head grow grander as seasons pass.','Season',93),(94,5,0,'It stores electricity in its cheek pouches and glides from treetops using its cape.','Sky Squirrel',94),(95,6,1,'When threatened, it spits an acidic fluid from its mouth to blind its opponents.','Clamping',95),(96,135,1,'Its massive steel armor protects it from heavy attacks. It strikes with its lance-like head.','Cavalry',96),(97,1,0,'It moves inside its shell to dodge danger. It can unleash rapid shell attacks.','Shelmet',97),(98,33,1,'By removing its heavy shell, it achieves incredible speed and ninja-like agility.','Shell Out',98),(99,1,1,'It lives in marshes and swamps. It can release electricity from its entire body surface.','Trap',99),(100,1,0,'It is very small and fast. It hitches a ride on larger Pokémon to travel.','Attaching',100),(101,11,1,'It creates electric webs between trees to catch flying insects and absorb their power.','EleSpider',101),(102,1,0,'It disguises itself as a Poké Ball to trick people and spray them with toxic spores.','Mushroom',102),(103,11,1,'It blows spores from its arms to put its opponents into a deep and troubled sleep.','Mushroom',103),(104,8,1,'It floats gracefully in ocean currents. It can drag its prey down to the deep sea.','Floating',104),(105,135,2,'Its body is mostly made of water. It creates castles of water to defend its territory.','Floating',105),(106,32,1,'It has a massive health pool. It uses its large body to block attacks and protect friends.','Caring',106),(107,9,0,'They attach themselves to rocks in caves and absorb minerals to grow their shells.','Thorn Pod',107),(108,110,1,'It fights by swinging its three spiked vines. Its steel spikes can shatter boulders.','Thorn Pod',108),(109,21,0,'By spinning its two gears at high speed, it generates a steady flow of electricity.','Gear',109),(110,51,1,'It communicates with its mini-gear by changing the rotation speed of its main core.','Gear',110),(111,81,1,'The core gear rotates at extreme speed, creating a powerful magnetic force field.','Gear',111),(112,0,0,'It cannot generate its own electricity, so it absorbs energy from modern machinery.','EleFish',112),(113,22,1,'It wraps itself around opponents to shock them with high-voltage electricity.','EleFish',113),(114,81,2,'It can crawl out of the water using its strong arms and attack prey on beaches.','EleFish',114),(115,9,1,'It uses its strong psychic powers to control and move objects many times its size.','Brain',115),(116,35,1,'It can rewrite the memories of its opponents using its flashing green fingers.','Brain',116),(117,3,0,'It shines a light in dark places, but it is actually draining the life energy of onlookers.','Candle',117),(118,13,1,'It arrives at the exact moment someone passes away to steal their spirit.','Lamp',118),(119,35,1,'Its eerie flames do not burn the physical body, but they consume the target\'s soul.','Luring',119),(120,18,1,'It rubs its horns against rocks to sharpen them. It trains relentlessly in dark caves.','Tusk',120),(121,36,1,'Its tusks are its pride. If they break, they can grow back stronger than before.','Axe Jaw',121),(122,106,2,'Its steel-hard tusks can slice through an iron beam. It is a terrifying combatant.','Axe Jaw',122),(123,10,1,'It loves cold environments. It creates frozen barriers around itself for safety.','Chill',123),(124,60,2,'It freezes its breath to create ice weapons. It can shatter a boulder with a kick.','Freezing',124),(125,73,1,'Its body is completely made of ice crystals. It does not melt even when dipped in magma.','Crystallizing',125),(126,6,0,'It trips its opponents using its long, flexible tail, then strikes with its claws.','Martial Arts',126),(127,36,1,'It handles its long arm fur like a whip to execute devastating physical strikes.','Martial Arts',127),(128,76,2,'Its skin is as tough as armor. It strikes opponents down with savage headbutts.','Cave',128),(129,16,1,'It animates clay bodies using ancient spiritual energy. It serves its creator.','Golem',129),(130,330,3,'An ancient robotic soldier that flies through the sky using rocket propulsion.','Golem',130),(131,10,1,'It uses its sharp arm blades to cut through river rocks. It follows orders blindly.','Sharp Blade',131),(132,70,2,'A relentless warrior clad in steel plates. It leads groups of Pawniard into battle.','Sword Blade',132),(133,93,2,'It charges at opponents with absolute ferocity, breaking barriers with its horns.','Buffalo Calf',133),(134,46,2,'Born out of a large egg, it trains its wings by fighting against powerful opponents.','Eaglet',134),(135,82,2,'The hero of the skies. It can carry a heavy car while flying across mountains.','Valiant',135),(136,9,0,'It chases after shiny objects and stores them in its nest. It is very mischievous.','Vulture',136),(137,40,1,'It makes its nest using the bones of its prey. It flies high to spot weak targets.','Bone Vulture',137),(138,58,1,'It makes its home in volcanic caves. It uses its flame beak to melt Durant armor.','Anteater',138),(139,28,0,'Clad in iron armor, it attacks in organized groups to protect its colony from Heatmor.','Iron Ant',134),(140,17,1,'It cannot see well, so it uses its feelers to explore and navigate dark caverns.','Irate',139),(141,50,1,'Since it has two heads, it requires double the amount of food to maintain its energy.','Hostile',140),(142,160,2,'A terrifying three-headed dragon that destroys everything in its path without mercy.','Brutal',141),(143,29,1,'It lives near volcanoes. It covers its body in silk to protect itself from fire.','Torch',142),(144,46,2,'Its six wings scatter fiery embers that can turn a dark night into a bright day.','Sun',143),(145,250,2,'A legendary guardian that fought against humans to protect the Pokémon of the forest.','Iron Will',144),(146,260,2,'Its massive charge can break through a fortress wall. It possesses extreme power.','Cavern',145),(147,200,2,'It can run through a battlefield at extreme speed, slicing enemies with its horns.','Grassland',146),(148,63,2,'It travels across the region causing fierce windstorms. It represents the skies.','Cyclone',147),(149,61,2,'It flies through the sky creating devastating lightning storms. It represents electricity.','Bolt Strike',148),(150,330,3,'A legendary dragon that represents the concept of Yang. It generates massive fire.','Vast White',149),(151,345,3,'A legendary dragon that represents the concept of Yin. It generates lightning.','Deep Black',150),(152,68,2,'It visits lands to enrich the soil using nutrients from the wind. It represents the earth.','Abundance',151),(153,325,3,'It stores an immense freezing energy inside its body, waiting for the chosen hero.','Boundary',152),(154,49,1,'A legendary Pokémon that trained in secret rivers to perfect its water sword skills.','Colt',153),(155,7,1,'Its beautiful songs can control the emotions of those who listen to its melody.','Melody',154),(156,83,2,'An ancient bug Pokémon modified by Team Plasma. It carries a heavy plasma cannon.','Paleozoic',155),(157,63,1,'Its Therian Forme allows it to fly with greater agility, soaring through windstorms.','Cyclone',156),(158,61,1,'In its Therian Forme, it absorbs massive electricity from clouds to maximize special attacks.','Bolt Strike',157),(159,68,1,'Its Therian Forme grants it an aggressive physiology, running over lands to command the fields.','Abundance',158),(160,325,3,'The fusion form of Kyurem and Zekrom. It channels severe electrical surges into its tusk.','Boundary',159),(161,325,4,'The fusion form of Kyurem and Reshiram. It overclocks its engine with blazing temperatures.','Boundary',160),(162,7,1,'Its Pirouette Forme allows it to perform stunning dances, changing its combat style completely.','Melody',161);
